      "content": "but it doesn't feel like it's just resting. it feels like the well has actually run dry. like the version of me that could actually feel things and make things... that person is just dead. and i'm just a hollow shell walking around pretending there's still something inside. what's the point of even trying to find it if it's never coming back?",
